WEBVTT

00:04:59.207 --> 00:05:02.976
miyadagi hissiyotlar holatini
neyronlar aloqasini yaxshilash orqali

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.000
jilmayganimizda iliq hislarni 
tuyishimizga ko’maklashadi.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.942
Tabassumning miyadagi rag’bat 
markaziga

00:05:09.966 --> 00:05:11.490
ta'sirini rohat hissini

00:05:11.514 --> 00:05:14.323
uyg’otuvchi vosita sifatida 
tanilgan shokoladga

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:15.506
ham qiyoslab bo’lmaydi.

00:05:16.077 --> 00:05:19.243
Britaniyalik tadqiqotchilar bir tabassum

00:05:19.267 --> 00:05:21.976
2000 ta shokolad qutisidagi 
shokoladlarni yeganingizdagi

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.976
miya stimulini yarata olishini aniqladi.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.648
(Kulgu)

00:05:27.672 --> 00:05:28.831
Shoshmang --

00:05:28.855 --> 00:05:32.662
Ayni shu tadqiqotda aytilishicha, 
tabassum qilish hisobingizga 16.000 funt